B.abK=new A.c8("How do I record a new sale?",'1. Go to the "Sales" section at the bottom of the screen.\n2. Select the products the customer wishes to buy.\n3. Click the "Checkout" button.\n4. Specify whether they are paying in cash or accumulating debt, then save the receipt.')
B.abA=new A.c8("How do I apply a discount for a customer?",'While creating a sale, in the checkout screen, simply enter the amount you want to deduct in the "Discount" field. The total will adjust automatically.')
B.abY=new A.c8("How do I process a return for a sold item?",'1. Go to the "Orders" section.\n2. Open the specific receipt.\n3. Click "Return".\n4. Enter the quantity being returned to adjust your inventory and total sales.')
B.abW=new A.c8("How do I view past receipts?",'In the "Orders" section, you will see a chronological list of all receipts. You can search by customer name or date to find exactly what you need.')
B.baV=s([B.abK,B.abA,B.abY,B.abW],t.bw)
B.aaR=new A.hX("Sales & Receipts",B.baV)
B.ab8=new A.c8("How do I add a new customer?",'1. Go to the "Customers" section.\n2. Click the add (+) button.\n3. Enter their name and phone number to start tracking their debts.')
B.abX=new A.c8("How do I collect a debt payment?",'1. Find the customer in the Customers list and click "Receive Payment".\n2. Enter the amount paid. The system will automatically reduce their outstanding debt.')
B.ac1=new A.c8("How do I check a customer's total debt?","The total debt is displayed right next to each customer's name in the list. Red text indicates outstanding unpaid debt.")
B.abb=new A.c8("How can I view a customer's history?","Tap on any customer's name to open their profile. You will see a complete history of their purchases, debts, and payments.")
B.b06=s([B.ab8,B.abX,B.ac1,B.abb],t.bw)
B.ab1=new A.hX("Customers & Debts",B.b06)
B.abd=new A.c8("How do I add a new product to my store?",'1. Go to the "Inventory" section and click the add (+) button.\n2. Enter the product name, buy price, sell price, and initial stock.\n3. You can also optionally enter a Supplier Name for your reference.')
B.abk=new A.c8("How do I change a product's price?",'In the Inventory section, tap the product, then click the "Edit" pencil icon. Update the price and save.')
B.abr=new A.c8("How do I set a low stock alert?",'When adding or editing a product, use the "Low Stock" threshold field. If you enter 5, the app alerts you in red when only 5 items are left.')
B.b9I=s([B.abd,B.abk,B.abr],t.bw)
B.ab4=new A.hX("Inventory & Products",B.b9I)
B.abe=new A.c8("How do I track store expenses or new stock?",'Go to the "Purchases" section at the top of the home screen. Record new stock purchases and expenses here to accurately track your profitability.')
B.abc=new A.c8("What if I return goods I purchased?",'Open the relevant purchase receipt in the Purchases section and select "Return" to adjust your inventory and financial records accordingly.')
B.ba3=s([B.abe,B.abc],t.bw)
B.ab0=new A.hX("Purchases & Expenses",B.ba3)
B.ac_=new A.c8("How do I invite an employee?",'1. Go to "Settings" -> "Invite Employees".\n2. Give the displayed 6-character code to your employee.\n3. They enter this code in their app to link to your store.')
B.abG=new A.c8("Why can't my employee log in?",'You must approve them first! Go to "Settings" -> "Manage Users", find their name, and click "Accept" to grant access.')
B.abE=new A.c8("How do I monitor employee actions?",'Check the "Audit Log" on your Dashboard. It provides a detailed trail of every action: who made a sale, collected debt, or edited a product.')
B.b04=s([B.ac_,B.abG,B.abE],t.bw)
B.aaY=new A.hX("Employee Management",B.b04)
B.abm=new A.c8("How can I make sure my data is safe?",'Your data is safely backed up in the cloud. For extra security, go to "Settings" -> "Export Data" and download a "Secure Full Backup" file to your device or Telegram.')
B.abf=new A.c8("How do I generate Excel (CSV) reports?",'In the "Export Data" section, you can download specialized Excel sheets for Customers, Monthly Sales, and Inventory.')
B.abw=new A.c8("How do I update my profile or profile picture?","Tap your name at the top of the Settings screen. Here you can edit your personal name, phone number, and upload a new profile picture.")
B.abg=new A.c8("How do I change the app language?","Scroll to the bottom of the Settings screen and select your preferred language (Kurdish, Arabic, or English). The app will update immediately.")
B.b_F=s([B.abm,B.abf,B.abw,B.abg],t.bw)
B.aaP=new A.hX("Settings & Data Backup",B.b_F)
B.aWI=s([B.aaR,B.ab1,B.ab4,B.ab0,B.aaY,B.aaP],t.c6)
